# Desired Responsibilities

The list below is aspirational and is not authorized for implementation by this document.

The module shall:

• Discover Apple TVs
• Authenticate securely
• Read playback status
• Wake and sleep Apple TV
• Send remote commands
• Synchronize playback state
• Report diagnostics

