# Acceptance Criteria

These criteria remain the required product outcome. Under ADR-009, experimental network-protocol behavior may satisfy them only after real-hardware verification; mock or simulator behavior is insufficient.

Apple TV is discovered automatically.

Pairing completes without manual configuration.

Remote controls respond reliably.

Playback information remains synchronized.

Network interruptions recover automatically.

Unsupported features remain hidden.

